            },
            "content": "<p>MAABench  <a href=\"https://huggingface.co/datasets/ming9999/maabench\" target=\"_blank\">https://huggingface.co/datasets/ming9999/maabench</a> \nUsed in Atlas <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.19583\" target=\"_blank\">https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.19583</a>\nusing generations from five recent model families: GPT (OpenAI, 2025), Claude (Anthropic, 2026a), Gemini (Google, 2026),\nMistral (Jiang et al., 2023), and Llama (Meta, 2025). The dataset contains 4 model versions for each\nmodel family, corresponding to different release versions. Specifically, in the version-OOD setting,\nthe oldest version is used for training, and the remaining three versions are used for test.</p>",
