      "raw_markdown": " MAABench  https://huggingface.co/datasets/ming9999/maabench \n\nUsed in Atlas https://arxiv.org/pdf/2610.19583\nusing generations from five recent model families: GPT (OpenAI, 2025), Claude (Anthropic, 2026a), Gemini (Google, 2026),\nMistral (Jiang et al., 2023), and Llama (Meta, 2025). The dataset contains 4 model versions for each\nmodel family, corresponding to different release versions. Specifically, in the version-OOD setting,\nthe oldest version is used for training, and the remaining three versions are used for test.",
